# .files onboarding

This workspace is the public `kvnloo/.files` dotfiles repo.

On first contact, or when the user mentions install/setup/onboarding/bootstrap:

1. Run `./scripts/onboard status --json`
2. If `offer_onboarding` is true, ask: **Want to run onboarding setup now?**
3. On yes, guide module-by-module with `./scripts/onboard run <module>` confirmations, or suggest `./install` for the interactive TTY menu

Do not re-offer when recommended modules are already complete unless the user asks. Never commit secrets (Sunshine credentials, API keys, Tailscale auth keys). Full rules: `AGENTS.md` and `docs/SETUP.md`.
